# Implementation Plan - Internationalization (i18n) using react-i18next

Add full i18n localization support to TableNova for **English (en)**, **Vietnamese (vi)**, and **Japanese (ja)** using `react-i18next` & `i18next`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The app will use `react-i18next` with automatic language detection (`i18next-browser-languagedetector`), fallback to `vi` / `en`, and seamless persistence in `localStorage`.

## Library Versions

The following npm packages are specified and installed in `package.json`:

- **`i18next`**: `^26.3.6` — Core internationalization framework
- **`react-i18next`**: `^17.0.11` — React 19 integration & translation hooks (`useTranslation`)
- **`i18next-browser-languagedetector`**: `^8.2.1` — Language detector (detects browser settings & saves preference in `localStorage`)

